            <description><![CDATA[<html><head><meta charset='utf-8'><style>:root{color-scheme:light dark}body{font:13px/1.45 -apple-system,system-ui,sans-serif;margin:0;padding:0 4px}h2{font-size:20px;margin:6px 0 4px}h3{font-size:13px;margin:16px 0 4px}p{margin:4px 0}.date{opacity:.6}ul{margin:4px 0;padding-left:20px}li{margin:4px 0}code{font:12px ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace}</style></head><body><h2>2.12</h2><p class="date">Release date: 5 Nov 2026</p><h3>New in 2.12</h3><ul><li>The free demo lasts 5 hours from install instead of 3 days; the mod shows the time left</li><li>The Rate app prompt appears 2 hours after install</li><li>The icons next to the bolt in the menu bar slide smoothly when the number changes width</li></ul></body></html>]]></description>
